<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.relay.opens`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "open the intent relay for a face and print its knock path"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.relay.opens", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.relay.opens"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.relay.opens"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.relay.opens ~ enable ~ the face answers on the relay

`lares intent-relay enable` mints the relay key where none stands, enables the relay for the face's persona group and answers the face's knock path and gate pin beside the relay's public admission key. `--json` prints the answer as data.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ enable

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`enable` params=`~ the face answers on the relay`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ json · face

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/json`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose relay switch moves, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the operator's switch over this vessel's own relay, through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ state · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`state` params=`exit/0 fields/[[face enabled standing path pin key]] ~ the face's relay state, its knock path and the relay's public key`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ [lares intent-relay] refused: names the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

